Z||000000||88 Fiero GT Turbo||09-23-2000||07:52 AM||||I was told that when you change your injectors to a bigger size you should have your chip burned for that size injector is this true or what?????<P>Thanks <P>Later,<BR>Jack<P>88 Fiero GT Turbo||||reg||5
